  "metadata": {
    "kind": "reel_native_tts",
    "slug": "medvedev-finals-road-2026"
  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "audio_sha256": "b92e8c6e93794f1dbaff211d2f242f687b4e7eeb8b3540f1af8effef5647d6fb",
      "duration_seconds": 8.568,
      "marks_sha256": "7d2aab45aef8fe17e8d8fbbf24f1d7c7c7b2f02aa448d3e17f1fcc163f309358",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "957357ed8b5de036b6ae04384cf6bdef",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "但中网半决赛，他在失分后把球打向看台，击中观众，被判失格。这也成了他今年的低点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "0f518d1473971602f3eed0bbddf64d0130441f3f66780e500e6fa830af1b76e4"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "16828f24945fbce417e7e726e4e325a8ed2c5c74ae605cae9868931c6dca6367",
      "duration_seconds": 7.848,
      "marks_sha256": "5a9e4c86c724e88fe0d46262201640958c311485008ccca8acdf9514604ea357",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e6984b83623f91a5eb77897da4ba5582",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网第四轮，面对蒂亚福，再次连丢三盘。今年四站大满贯，他没有一次打进8强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "12320d07426ea885a8bea400a8fc39df3280d13ca332140d7152b6710abf96d9"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "9f005841bb4446bf4da770205ad1ef5e14e0719c17f06f5c674f12bf8feb4852",
      "duration_seconds": 7.656,
      "marks_sha256": "203dc062650342d6ab0afb89966f26e5f2b598e47a19e502f34bcad688c67275",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e5d89f79d8ee7c96b2df6ce849e55c21",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "新赛季第一站，他就在布里斯班夺冠。决赛两盘击败中岛布兰登，冠军来得很早。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "18f1d1848fcc285538b69d4c7e61eebcb7bfeaf0dd22ca06d86ab40a7a02e60a"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "502f3de82856596ef959bac284ec1b4eb54b4a9f0ae305b359366f4329483526",
      "duration_seconds": 6.192,
      "marks_sha256": "46284596b92c4dd9faad65a8fe765a6e4224842fad1da91f4f5518d0ef71f67c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e1df66c2d5400e2ca6a80202cc5171c2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他是二零二零年的年终冠军。到了都灵，你还看好梅德韦德夫吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "23654ca25058101eeae1ef722ca77bc51ed9cbfaf578a3f74f097d1d89909b55"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "d389393033c56bec6e847f2d5e9e9e51824c22a97f5e522ad5e4e53fbc74f150",
      "duration_seconds": 7.224,
      "marks_sha256": "8d59b536b35a7215f9428d08efc4ef9208ee98c6bac8683a15004e60b4cac640",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "8d47c29e193979af5f92fd5e133591b2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "澳网却很快给了他一记重击。第四轮对勒纳·钱，连丢三盘，第二盘还是零比六。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "25b8b5eb429acb51d2daf0f4d657bbedd7b0ac23f2c380dbce61bec36b34674f"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "cb4c87a926661923f4e0cf87ef81526544342e9591e13b3cfc886cc7dc26c88d",
      "duration_seconds": 9.744,
      "marks_sha256": "a24936ac27da30394e06af30a07a2d7c68cbf42682646901c155a842af4095fd",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "282393a142a83596d728667d0827b9bc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "上海打进4强之后，他来到阿拉木图。决赛先丢一盘，再以六比一、六比三翻回来，拿到赛季第四冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "4694253a1174a63382d8e61a82add636bf7a18ea881840103e45b8afcee0bbdc"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "6e941eb90ea46c567aeb60f97584562411005e8f3d12e0901c6165cdb48cd62d",
      "duration_seconds": 10.056,
      "marks_sha256": "2f5d9740ab2decc5b13f5f5ee12c13a4f3812e41c414ae33f4aab3abae256701",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "97f308d5661672f1ac444dc3d012c04b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年拿到四个单打冠军，四大满贯却都没进8强。去年缺席年终的梅德韦德夫，是怎样把都灵门票赢回来的？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "4989f7a932d0b2eaa9a61eb916398f6759f41512d17c757a3fd86ddd4b788bb2"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "4acb0cf83b6964d1dde62a75d7f8dbc14494b8f47042a5c421eae6a9265b5b01",
      "duration_seconds": 7.656,
      "marks_sha256": "5a08d4e3ed11a2111f6ea1c0747e1c76328622f876772c3e9242b6fbc4a742fa",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f010f505165f0740bf03ba0b477f6e66",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网第三轮，斯特鲁夫又挡住了他。两盘抢七告负，第三盘再输五比七。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "502550d2fdab0b8116efc375feb12470121a004fbccfde9a20c2961f6a8d0920"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "9a3cbfdec2c17518637f8d4964d5a1c88bf3ce17fa33e704ae627fb94e52b629",
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "marks_sha256": "c90ab0158259a752476ebf40686f9e0c9eb77637499faa3bcda5e09a0fece790",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5ba6b58f2d37aec18bd5e6faed07e013",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二月的迪拜，决赛对手格里克斯普尔赛前因伤退赛，他拿到本季第二座单打冠军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "66f51296dde6c0681cbb2e1cdb2bbd92fdb819c1e575bb8f4f5fc7f45bbc0759"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "eebbb1c080cfc9f5fa689eb6b961be60df4ef7451913b749c3b09524d8eaffe1",
      "duration_seconds": 12.216,
      "marks_sha256": "765a71f7c735546ab212c60bfc29ea2afac23f35a16185685bce2cb1ba54518a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "633ce95ebac6534e46e95675d2ac63a2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "红土赛季，低谷更深。蒙特卡洛两盘零比六。到了法网，首轮打满五盘。决胜盘四比二领先，却连丢四局，输给沃尔顿。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "69bb3b9b0e738a261a79ca47bfd09f941c7af8a499c9255f88fb7e65c77a3723"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "8f4e7709be21132dc512a67c16d0686f13409c9604e342d31d9e2d101940ce80",
      "duration_seconds": 7.272,
      "marks_sha256": "73beb90e2b57da02712aed51a9f8f7f385020b5da8ad05563b05823870898551",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7a3475b3ac51313330b1e07a3e1d665d",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "转折出现在中国赛季。杭州决赛，两盘击败卢布列夫，拿到年度第三冠。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "8dbc2dbde99fbd8d910ac1b309a7b33006e034e2d6d9928e1876e06aa80e5625"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "5e79e5655e47efc2c0d3cee79eaeb80b9ff840b05900c74b39a6b72a62d8d70e",
      "duration_seconds": 4.104,
      "marks_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "b2a8bcfde33dd58847c52854c9cc7017990d21d9694e5114722cf52865e38813",
      "duration_seconds": 8.328,
      "marks_sha256": "7ec6fb5956c7b2c9fbe91e07b78e8823e8116711d9d42b420cd5e555d6876c93",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "91c27ec92d21db431a14474ee986c618",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "巴黎第二轮，他以四比六、四比六输给布赛。巴黎的征程结束，接下来，目光转向都灵。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "beb406b8bd7c6ca18e13996e56e0e3d49e5c22f9e800252e6fb85c46ffb8a5fc"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "bf2e67892d83de6d107c4eeff55daf1d5bfe4018ac9dfa5098d7ab91546aeeda",
      "duration_seconds": 7.008,
      "marks_sha256": "b606e0de649ff26ddd5d404ef2b6fd83161033708f877614715e37d10040d533",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "044fa89aa37c6f65f2b6414065eb7ac0",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第七次入围，隔了一届又回来了。这张门票，是一站一站累积回来的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "c02391121bb087f48c5ba99a517d21af247545336a65676a3772c34ea85ac974"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "b9c8191381bfd7926c05dfb0c2381b9b2507139c4d67139a59c9ed83dd80cd98",
      "duration_seconds": 7.92,
      "marks_sha256": "a8cfa7febd48bc259a8ee8e2044b8e1f7658e0f2023d51cb9deb71ec389d1046",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9c5178836a97f26844328441fd7e7833",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十月三十日，维也纳四分之一决赛。两盘击败马纳里诺，梅德韦德夫终于锁定年终资格。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "c5c11f0ca3411850f88433459e6b8bd98561005ea1d508f1da51e2eb4a8c3966"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "cbdcf68cb42001219ba745357a34b8187adc7dc42182dceda326a2b41a4ffb37",
      "duration_seconds": 8.424,
      "marks_sha256": "946285f50179a7c68a07d541f014f4415478b7b67669aca6fa941c639335df72",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b3ce1ea0889cb0707b50576bd8f6a144",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "印第安维尔斯，他在半决赛击败阿尔卡拉斯，闯进大师赛决赛。两盘抢七，还是输给辛纳。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "cf8e5a92b6d3392ff7df6bc1cbc76d4da14786d0e9b61f3c5ae880535440e85d"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "a57c7eb7bea2af7710cb29ecfddda71c5268b2d3a2d6891806244865bd231b65",
      "duration_seconds": 8.52,
      "marks_sha256": "e0f37de6be8d319c07ca6eb7a2d3a45909ef673c07e9d50820a3ceab989fe333",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e82f03f36b6a11b5b96ded97e167ccbf",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "他终于在同一站，连续两年捧起冠军奖杯。二十五座单打冠军，这是他第一次成功卫冕。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "f090e1423408f96f95f60074a6dc5ceafb4c7480a80efb9708a43a67c151dbb8"
    },
    {
      "audio_sha256": "bd9fc704befc03dcc5155515a705b1c737811247859fb356bfea4591ec685d13",
      "duration_seconds": 4.104,
      "marks_sha256": "9189e6974302de021002b2d03f8265af28a9bd747ed9dea82b65f200e3c3728c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7d5573a41766d3d094589e56a3bc2df3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "梅德韦德夫年终路，四冠之后重返都灵。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "request_id": "f53a3a7a9368d331998a4c6cea12a75415b2275f3283bb20aa44efee08d9bf85"
    }
  ]
}
